# BiasLens uses the Gemini API for bias detection.
# Get a free API key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# 
# You don't need a .env file — paste your API key directly
# into the extension's Settings panel after installing.
#
# For development, you can optionally set it here:
# WXT_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
